    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.armor.name": "鎧胄",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.armor.description": "諸般鎧胄之效",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.name": "初唐明光鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.0.text": "初唐明光鎧，乃唐初明光甲之形製。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套此鎧遭击，有二成之機率令敵兵兵器偃息四息；未具全套，觸發機率亦为二成。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.3.text": "全鎧在身，箭矢無傷，且可反弹来矢；行速增两成。若乘兽，坐騎得堅膚Ⅱ、疾行Ⅱ、生息之效。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.text": "上圖为此鎧形製。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.text": "上圖为此兵形製。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.name": "中唐明光鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.0.text": "中唐明光鎧，明光甲中期之式。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭劍、三叉戟所击，六成機率减四成創痛；未集全鎧，機率降为三成。全鎧可御箭矢，反弹来矢。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.3.text": "身着全套，奔走之速增两成；乘兽之时，坐騎得堅膚Ⅱ、疾行Ⅱ、生息Ⅱ。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.name": "晚唐明光鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.0.text": "晚唐明光鎧，明光甲晚世之式。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭劍、三叉戟所击，六成機率减四成創痛；未集全鎧，機率降为三成。全鎧可御箭矢，反弹来矢。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.3.text": "身着全套，奔走之速增两成；乘兽之时，坐騎得堅膚Ⅱ、疾行Ⅲ、騰躍Ⅱ。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.name": "步人鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.0.text": "步人鎧，宋世重步之甲。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.2.text": "全套在身，奔走之速减两成五分。具全鎧则有衝撞、死衝二能；疾奔可撞飞周遭生靈，損其一氣，掀之二丈，每撞一兽耗一腹飽。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.3.text": "自身氣血不足两成，恒得雄力Ⅱ、御創Ⅱ、迅疾Ⅲ。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.name": "山文鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.0.text": "山文鎧，中土特色札甲。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭劍、三叉戟击，三成機率减两成創痛；未集全鎧，機率降为一成。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.3.text": "自高坠下，离地三丈，自动得缓坠之效。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.name": "唐步卒鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.0.text": "唐步卒鎧，唐寻常步卒之护具。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.2.text": "鐵製唐步卒鎧未有异能，防护與寻常鐵鎧無异。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.3.text": "后续奇能，敬候更新。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.name": "細鱗鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.0.text": "細鱗鎧，轻便护具。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭劍、三叉戟击，三成機率减两成創痛；未集全鎧，機率降为一成。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.3.text": "身着此鎧，不惧甜莓刺創，亦能免方天畫戟牽曳之术。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.name": "烏錘鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.0.text": "烏錘鎧，厚重护鎧。可於甲冶鍛台，取甲片、甲坯與諸材合铸；亦可用對應鍛靈石升造，詳參材料篇·鍛靈石。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.1.text": "此鎧可采鐵、金、金剛、玄鈺四材造之，今以鐵製为例述其功用。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭劍、三叉戟击，六成機率减四成創痛；未集全鎧，機率降为三成。遇重錘下击，可减半創痛，非全套亦有效，觸發機率五成。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.3.text": "全套在身，三成機率反还五成創痛於敵；未集全鎧，機率一成。全套遭击，四成機率令敵兵兵器偃息三息，未集全鎧则为二成。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.weapons.name": "兵械",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.glaive.name": "偃月刀",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.glaive.pages.0.text": "偃月刀，長柄利刃。击敵八成機率令其血溢五息；潜行右击可旋斩，傷增二分，每斩耗一腹飽。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.glaive.pages.1.text": "偃月刀可采木、石、金、鐵、金剛、玄鈺铸之；亦可以鐵偃月刀合太古靈璞，鍛青龙偃月刀。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.dagger_axe.name": "戈",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.dagger_axe.pages.0.text": "戈，先秦長柄勾啄之器。右击猛勾，可牽無坐騎之敵至身前，損其二氣；",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.dagger_axe.pages.1.text": "若敵乘兽，三成機率掀其下鞍，此击耗戈一分堅利。寻常刺击八成機率令敵裂創五息。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.sky_piercing_halberd.name": "方天畫戟",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.sky_piercing_halberd.pages.0.text": "方天畫戟，重型長柄神兵，有橫斩、牽馬二技。潜行挥击则橫斩，掀敵二丈，血溢五息；乘兽挥击则牽馬，",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.sky_piercing_halberd.pages.1.text": "敵無坐騎，则强牽随行五息，彼不能攻走，唯可騰躍，每躍三成機率脱缚，同时身中裂創五息。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.weapons.description": "諸兵之用法與异能",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.materials.name": "材料",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.materials.description": "諸般造甲之材",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.forging_stone.name": "鍛靈石",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.forging_stone.pages.0.text": "鍛靈石，取諸般山石合石英鍛成，如花冈、闪長之属；不同山石得對應鎧之鍛靈石。置寻常鎧與鍛靈石於鍛台，可铸本模奇鎧。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.armor_pieces.name": "甲片&甲坯",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.armor_pieces.pages.0.text": "甲片可合为甲坯，用以铸多数鎧胄",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.armor_pieces.pages.1.text": "山文甲片可合山文甲坯，专铸山文鎧",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.other.name": "杂記",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.other.description": "製模相关紀事",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.other.mainfest.pages.1.text": "§l華夏甲兵襄助名錄：$(br)§r星屹工作室（CTN STUDIO）-主事，sf.-編碼，末影洁-編碼，Xiris-造模繪像，星零大隊長-繪像，小史龙吖（Slime_Dragon）-繪像，Призмарин-俄譯，方漓猫-基岩版移植$(br)§l鳴謝§r：$(br)spake404-代碼輔持，BaiGave-代碼輔持，阳炎-献策，叹息之塔-吉祥物。",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.other.mainfest.pages.0.text": "此製由星屹工作室主持打造，論道群：1102108787",
    "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.other.mainfest.pages.2.text": "星屹工作室官址",
